{"words": [{"text": "قَالَتْ", "translation": "She said"}, {"text": "رَبِّ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "أَنَّىٰ", "translation": "how"}, {"text": "يَكُونُ", "translation": "is [it]"}, {"text": "لِى", "translation": "for me"}, {"text": "وَلَدٌۭ", "translation": "a boy"}, {"text": "وَلَمْ", "translation": "and (has) not"}, {"text": "يَمْسَسْنِى", "translation": "touch(ed) me"}, {"text": "بَشَرٌۭ ۖ", "translation": "any man"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكِ", "translation": "Thus"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَخْلُقُ", "translation": "creates"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ ۚ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "قَضَىٰٓ", "translation": "He decrees"}, {"text": "أَمْرًۭا", "translation": "a matter"}, {"text": "فَإِنَّمَا", "translation": "then only"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "He says"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "to it"}, {"text": "كُن", "translation": "Be"}, {"text": "فَيَكُونُ", "translation": "and it becomes"}], "sahih": "She said, \"My Lord, how will I have a child when no man has touched me?\" [The angel] said, \"Such is Allāh; He creates what He wills. When He decrees a matter, He only says to it, 'Be,' and it is."}